The songs is 3, while the goal is 3.
The gap is 1.
The modulo is 1000000007.
The width is songs plus 1.
The size is (goal plus 1) times width.
The ways is a list of size zeros.
Set item 0 of ways to 1.
For every length from 1 to goal.
For every unique from 1 to songs.
If length is at least unique.
The at is length times width plus unique.
The before is (length minus 1) times width plus (unique minus 1).
The fresh is item before of ways times (songs minus unique plus 1).
The prior is (length minus 1) times width plus unique.
The old is item prior of ways.
The factor is the larger of unique minus gap and 0.
The reuse is old times factor.
The total is fresh plus reuse.
The reduced is total modulo modulo.
Set item at of ways to reduced.

The target is goal times width plus songs.
Report item target of ways.
